{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24192","headline":"拜表回闲游 · 白居易","name":"拜表回闲游","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉佩金章紫花绶，紵衫藤带白纶巾。\n晨兴拜表称朝士，晚出游山作野人。\n达磨传心令息念，玄元留意遣同尘。\n八关净戒斋销日，一曲狂歌醉送春。\n酒肆法堂方丈室，其间岂是两般身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24192.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24192","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}